    "< Prev": "< 上一页",
    "<html>Pick the device, map each logical input to the physical axis/button, then use the live monitor below. When you move the physical joystick, the <b>Physical axes/buttons</b> section must react. If it reacts there but not in <b>Mapped outputs</b>, the profile mapping is wrong for the selected robot.</html>": "<html>选择设备，将每个逻辑输入映射到物理轴/按钮，然后使用下方实时监视器。移动物理摇杆时，<b>物理轴/按钮</b>区域必须响应。如果该区域有响应但<b>映射输出</b>没有响应，则所选机器人的配置映射不正确。</html>",
    "<html>Use <b>NONE</b> to disable an axis and keep using the selected robot. To convert an axis to digital buttons, choose or type entries like <b>BTN:BASE_POS,BASE_NEG</b>. You can also combine sources manually, for example <b>BASE|BTN:BASE_POS,BASE_NEG</b>.</html>": "<html>使用 <b>NONE</b> 禁用某个轴并继续使用所选机器人。要将轴转换为数字按钮，请选择或输入类似 <b>BTN:BASE_POS,BASE_NEG</b> 的条目。也可以手动组合来源，例如 <b>BASE|BTN:BASE_POS,BASE_NEG</b>。</html>",
